        5.0,
        25.0
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "speaker": "instructor_sumit",
        "text": "Excretion is the biological process of expelling non-gaseous nitrogenous wastes such as ammonia, urea, and uric acid along with excess water, salts, and pigments out of the body."
      }
    },
