      "attributes": {
        "speaker": "instructor_sumit",
        "text": "Examining the anatomy of the human kidney, each adult kidney is 10 to 12 centimeters long, 5 to 7 centimeters wide, 2 to 3 centimeters thick, and weighs 120 to 170 grams, situated between the thoracic and lumbar vertebra."
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "node_bio_seg_06",
      "label": "The inner concave surface features a notch called ...",
